{"seq":2,"slug":"media-ecology","title":"媒介理论与媒介生态","stage":"DONE","category":"media-communication","chapterCount":3,"docCount":10,"url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.21,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 媒介理论与媒介生态 简介\n\n媒介理论与媒介生态是从媒介本身出发理解传播现象的理论体系。不同于关注传播内容和效果的研究路径，媒介理论认为媒介形式本身就是塑造社会和文化的核心力量。从麦克卢汉的\"媒介即讯息\"到当代的算法媒体研究，这一领域持续揭示着媒介技术如何深刻改变人类的认知方式和社会组织形态。\n\n本知识库面向对媒介理论和数字媒体生态感兴趣的专业人士，适合从事媒体产品设计、内容平台运营和数字传播研究等方向的从业者。\n\n全书分为三章，从经典理论到当代生态系统逐步展开：\n\n第一章**媒介理论**介绍麦克卢汉等学者的经典媒介理论，帮助读者理解媒介如何塑造人的感知和社会结构。第二章**媒介演化**追溯从印刷媒体到数字媒体的演化历程，分析融合文化和平台化媒体等当代趋势。第三章**媒介生态系统**探讨媒介生态学、信息生态和算法媒体等前沿议题。\n\n建议读者先通过经典理论建立媒介分析的思维框架，再了解媒介演化的历史脉络，最后深入当代媒介生态系统的复杂现实。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"media-theory","title":"媒介理论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mcluhan-medium","title":"麦克卢汉媒介理论","url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-theory/mcluhan-medium"},{"seq":2,"slug":"media-determinism","title":"媒介决定论","url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-theory/media-determinism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"media-affordances","title":"媒介可供性理论","url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-theory/media-affordances"},{"seq":4,"slug":"medium-is-message","title":"媒介即讯息的当代诠释","url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-theory/medium-is-message"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"media-evolution","title":"媒介演化","docCount":3,"url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"print-to-digital","title":"从印刷到数字的媒介变迁","url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-evolution/print-to-digital"},{"seq":2,"slug":"convergence-culture","title":"融合文化","url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-evolution/convergence-culture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-media","title":"平台媒体","url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-evolution/platform-media"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"media-ecosystem","title":"媒介生态系统","docCount":3,"url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-ecosystem","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"media-ecology-theory","title":"媒介生态学理论","url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-ecosystem/media-ecology-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"information-ecology","title":"信息生态学","url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-ecosystem/information-ecology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"algorithmic-media","title":"算法媒介","url":"/h/media-communication/media-ecology/media-ecosystem/algorithmic-media"}]}]}